<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">從弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0002" ref="31b_fd1_f77">玄謨</persName>子<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0005" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>，宋明帝世為黃門郎，素輕世祖。世祖時在大床寢，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0029" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>謂豫章王曰：「帳中物亦復隨人寢興。」世祖銜之，未嘗形色。建元元年，為冠軍將軍、永嘉太守，詣闕跪拜不如儀，為守寺所列。有司以啟世祖，世祖召<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0098" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>入東宮，仍送付廷尉殺之。遣左右口啟上曰：「父辱子死，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0125" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">王瞻</persName>傲慢朝廷，臣輒以收治。」太祖曰：「語郎，此何足計！」旣聞<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001:m0155" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>已死，乃默無言。</p>
</text>
